Third-year high school student. At the beginning of the story, she is saved by Haruto during a car accident, and because of that, she goes full deredere mode on him afterwards. In order to repay Haruto, she looked after him during his hospitalization. Because she is a sheltered girl, she doesn't understand much about relationships with boys, and is bad at communicating with them. After Haruto gets discharged from the hospital, she moves in with him as his caretaker."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10367"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"知徳学院3年生"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"事故に遭いかけたところを主人公に助けられ、恩返しと面倒を見るために主人公が住む部屋へとやってくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家事全般得意で、特に料理は上手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の好みに健気に合わせようとするところがあり、隣の部屋に住んでいる「恋愛の大先輩」だと思っている簾に色々と話を聞いたり、ネットでいろいろ調べて偏った知識でご奉仕することも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いい家系のお嬢様のためか、男女関係や、生活習慣など世間とずれているところがあるが、妹の小乃花に対してだけははっきりと分かりやすい形でヤキモチを焼く。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「……は、遥人さんの、お隣で……眠らせて、いただきました……」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5179","sourceWorkId":"17485","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"知徳学院3年生"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"事故に遭いかけたところを主人公に助けられ、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恩返しと面倒を見るために主人公が住む部屋へとやってくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家事全般得意で、特に料理は上手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の好みに健気に合わせようとするところがあり、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"隣の部屋に住んでいる「恋愛の大先輩」だと思っている簾に色々と話を聞いたり、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ネットでいろいろ調べて偏った知識でご奉仕することも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いい家系のお嬢様のためか、男女関係や、生活習慣など世間とずれているところがあるが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妹の小乃花に対してだけははっきりと分かりやすい形でヤキモチを焼く。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5179","sourceWorkId":"25106","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"知徳学院3年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"事故に遭いかけたところを主人公に助けられ、恩返しと怪我の面倒を見るために部屋へとやってくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お嬢様なためか男女の関係にうとく、少しズレていたり、生活習慣が世間の常識とやや違うところがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「遥人さんのお世話を、させていただきたいんです」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"26027"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"87 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5179","sourceWorkId":"17485","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"d","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5179","sourceWorkId":"17485","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"157 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5179","sourceWorkId":"17485","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"85 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5179","sourceWorkId":"17485","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"56 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5179","sourceWorkId":"17485","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dc936179672511583082404a8faa6b1b09ad0d159780ad08b21373f4074e2c3e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/56/56fbdd28fff7c5c6ade5eb51212daeeffa00210602e24bcc884383a32475da34.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"尾崎真実","creatorId":"vndb:s199","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s199","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s199","name":"尾崎 真実","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:46870:26027:8165:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c10368","characterName":"徳吉 優子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"26028","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"46870"}],"egsCharacterIds":["5180"],"vndbCharacterId":"c10368"},"originalCharacterName":"徳吉 優子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"82"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"B"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"162"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"83"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Third-year high school student and Haruto's childhood friend. She is a cheerful girl that likes taking care of others, therefore she is very popular at school. She is in love with Haruto, but is too stubborn to admit her feelings. After meeting Ayano, she moves in with them and began to express her feelings more openly."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10368"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"知徳学院3年生"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小学校時代の幼馴染で、世話焼き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"昔から主人公が好きだったが、気持ちを伝えることができないまま主人公が引っ越し疎遠に。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が大学に入学するにあたり再び優子の家の近くに一人暮らしすることになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼馴染という関係に満足できずにいるが最後の一歩が踏み出せず、時間をかけてのんびりやろうと考えていたところ、綾乃の一件を知り、気持ちを抑えきれなくなる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"素直になりきれないので、何かしらの理由を付けては、主人公に関わってくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家事一般は普通にこなせる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「じゃあ、この状況を説明して。ちゃんと、私が納得できるように！」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5180","sourceWorkId":"17485","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"知徳学院3年生。主人公の幼なじみ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく面倒見のよい女の子で後輩にも人気がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公に淡い想いを抱いていたが、言い出せずにいた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、綾乃と主人公が同棲をすることを知り、自分も一緒にいたいと考えるようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「はああぁぁ……。まったくもう……ハル兄ってば、ばっかじゃないの？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"26028"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"82 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5180","sourceWorkId":"17485","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"b","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5180","sourceWorkId":"17485","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"162 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5180","sourceWorkId":"17485","sourceFie