e":"76"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"54"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Haruto's younger sister and a HUGE brocon. She would often come to his brother's place to play and ends up spending the night there. Her dreams for the future is to become her Onii-chan's bride. After learning about her brother and Ayano's relationship, she was shocked, but gradually warms up to Ayano due to her kind and warm nature."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10455"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"純粋で内気なほのぼのドジ。庇護欲をそそられるタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お兄ちゃん大好き妹で、兄が居ないと不安で夜も寝られず、おしっこも満足に出来ないため体調を崩すため、定期的に主人公の部屋を訪れ週末を二人で過ごしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分より美人で綺麗、なんでもできる綾乃に憧れている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お兄ちゃんにふさわしい女の子になりたい！　と綾乃に色々と習いながら、努力するように。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「やーだー、お兄ちゃんじゃないとダメなのーっ！」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5184","sourceWorkId":"17485","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"お兄ちゃんのことが大好きな、主人公の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一人暮らしをしている部屋によく遊びに来ては泊まっていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"将来の夢は “お兄ちゃんのお嫁さん” だったため、主人公と綾乃が付き合っていることを知って軽くショックを受ける。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"優しく何でも出来る綾乃のことを好きになり、お姉さんと慕い、憧れるようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「やーだー、お兄ちゃんじゃないとダメなのーっ！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"26032"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"69 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5184","sourceWorkId":"17485","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"aa","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5184","sourceWorkId":"17485","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"144 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5184","sourceWorkId":"17485","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"76 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5184","sourceWorkI