out this issue, but she is in fact a virgin."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10456"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"社会人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の隣の部屋に住んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目は仕事のできるやり手の美人だが、中身はかなり残念。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"えっちに興味津々で中学生の男の子のようなメンタリティのため、偏って間違った知識をヒロインに教えることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ま、その辺りは、宴会でもしながら、楽しく話しましょうか」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5185","sourceWorkId":"17485","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"陣富荘の住人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外では “出来る女” だが、家に戻るととたんにずぼらになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お酒が大好きで、理由を見つけては宴会を開こうとする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋愛やセックスの経験が豊富だと思われ相談に載っているが、実は処女で誰とも付き合ったことがない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「んふふ～。どうかしらね。どちらかといえば、遥人くんにアレコレするほうかしら～」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"26033"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"85 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5185","sourceWorkId":"17485","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"b","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5185","sourceWorkId":"17485","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"156 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5185","sourceWorkId":"17485","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"83 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5185","sourceWorkId":"17485","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5185","sourceWorkId":"17485","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e2/e2f3a0c46f14e8a6c6e8feeb4f13659740d7eeacfcc89a859381194c0ca73ec8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/05/05a2bc098c31186141818863c2b95da0677d153d87951f211179072d3f137997.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"